HotCarrier™ Solar Panels can be seamlessly integrated with the SolisCell™ rechargeable battery block to provide efficient, sustainable power for your Frame Tower, even in low-sunlight environments. A drone survey of your location will assess direct sunlight hours to determine optimal panel sizes and mounting positions for maximum performance.

